<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title><%= h title %> · GregoireF tap</title>
<meta name="description" content="Homebrew, Scoop and WinGet packages for the GregoireF tools, verified and install-tested before they are published.">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" title="New versions" href="<%= depth %>feed.xml">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #fbfbf9; --fg: #1d1d1b; --muted: #61615c; --line: #e3e2dc;
  --card: #ffffff; --code: #f2f1ec; --accent: #2f6b4f; --warn: #8a5a00;
  color-scheme: light;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #141413; --fg: #ecebe6; --muted: #a3a29b; --line: #2e2e2b;
    --card: #1c1c1a; --code: #252522; --accent: #7fc4a0; --warn: #e0b45c;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
  font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
main, header, footer { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
header { padding-top: 2.5rem; }
header a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; line-height: 1.2; margin: 1.5rem 0 .5rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 2rem 0 .5rem; }
p.lead { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
.tools { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.tools li { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; }
.tools a.name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: .8rem; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 99px;
  border: 1px solid currentColor; color: var(--accent); }
.badge.checksum { color: var(--warn); }
pre { background: var(--code); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; overflow-x: auto;
  font: 14px/1.5 ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", Menlo, monospace; }
footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><a href="<%= depth %>">GregoireF tap</a></header>
<main>
<%= body %>
</main>
<footer>
Generated from <a href="https://github.com/GregoireF/homebrew-tap/blob/main/tools.yml">tools.yml</a>.
Every version was checked against its release's checksums and installed on macOS, Linux and Windows before it was published.
<a href="<%= depth %>feed.xml">Atom feed</a> ·
<a href="https://github.com/GregoireF/homebrew-tap">Source</a>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
